WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.10 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Policy management and review

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Policies protect people only when they are approved, known, followed and kept up to date.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Track version, owner, approver and next review.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Review on schedule, after incidents and when you register.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Link acknowledgements to onboarding; archive old versions.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You set up your policy register and review schedule.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
